  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><span><span>In mid-October 2025, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></div><ul><li><p><span><span>Improve the</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>r</span><span>edirect connection type to</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>require</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>only</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>port 1433 and</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>promote to</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>default.</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"http://aka.ms/sqlmi-redirect-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Convert Azure SQL Database to Hyperscale while preserving existing geo-replication or failover group settings.</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/hs-conversion-geodr-ga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul>",
    "Markdown": "In mid-October 2025, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nImprove the r edirect connection type to require only port 1433 and promote to default. Learn more .\n\nConvert Azure SQL Database to Hyperscale while preserving existing geo-replication or failover group settings. Learn more ."
  },
